e removal removes n:N8 and e:2000008, so the pre-window e:2000008 row is removed and the word does not come back. N7 is deleted in E, so its put keeps e:2000007 (re-keyed to a tombstoned note the item would be hidden).\",\"A pushes with the clock still wrong. The creations and the three e:<seq> puts into Mining are clock_ahead (Mining exists); card.created, the review, n:N into Mining and e:2000001 into Trip are unknown_reference.\",\"Re-mint: W = {both word notes, the card, N, Trip}. e:2000001 and e:2000003 in Mining are window-derived (their seqs are entries of notes in W): re-minted with keys n:<note>, which writes a window row and is the same item as e:<seq> by effective identity (8.5); e:2000003 is placed after its note. e:2000009 names no window note: discarded (shown in the discard list). n:N in Mining and e:2000001 in Trip write window rows: re-minted unchanged.\",\"A also reviewed the new card an hour after creating it (unknown_reference). It is re-minted in step 6b with a new id and reviewed_at shifted by the same delta as the creations, so it stays an hour after its card. `remint` lists the inputs; tools/validate.py recomputes the selection and the shift.\"],\"order_free\":true,\"rejected\":[{\"after_seq\":4,\"code\":\"clock_ahead\",\"op\":{\"device_id\":\"01931f3e-0000-7000-8000-0000000000a1\",\"entity_id\":\"0193a1b2-0001-7000-8000-00a100000005\",\"entity_type\":\"note\",\"hlc\":\"0193da58b400-0000-01931f3e-0000-7000-8000-0000000000a1\",\"op_id\":\"0193a1b2-00ff-7000-8000-00a100000007\",\"op_type\":\"note.created\",\"op_version\":1,\"payload\":{\"entry_seq\":2000001,\"id\":\"0193a1b2-0001-7000-8000-00a100000005\",\"note_type_id\":\"00000000-0000-7000-8000-000000000101\"}},\"received_at\":1733848306624},{\"after_seq\":4,\"code\":\"unknown_reference\",\"op\":{\"device_id\":\"01931f3e-0000-7000-8000-0000000000a1\",\"entity_id\":\"0193a1b2-0002-7000-8000-00a100000006\",\"entity_type\":\"card\",\"hlc\":\"0193da58b400-0001-01931f3e-0000-7000-8000-0000000000a1